 for identification of Chinese medicinal materials</article-title><source>Chin Med</source><year>2007</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>9</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17803808</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1749-8546-2-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name><name><surname>Han</surname><given-names>QB</given-names></name><name><surname>Qiao</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><name><surname>Song</surname><given-names>JZ</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>HX</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chemical markers for the quality control of herbal medicines: an overview</article-title><source>Chin Med</source><year>2008</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>7</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18588699</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1749-8546-3-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>WF</given-names></name><name><surname>Wan</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhu</surname><given-names>ZY</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>GY</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Simultaneous determination of eight major bioactive compounds in Dachengqi Tang (DT) by high-performance liquid chromatography</article-title><source>Chin Med</source><year>2008</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>5</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18445276</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1749-8546-3-5</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Song</surname><given-names>JZ</given-names></name><name><surname>Han</surna